# loopA and loopB name each other as parent.  loopChild is a subtrack of loopA.
track loneTrack
shortLabel lone
longLabel A track with no parent
type bed 3

track loopA
compositeTrack on
parent loopB
shortLabel loop A
longLabel Loop A names loop B as parent
type bed 3

track loopB
compositeTrack on
parent loopA
shortLabel loop B
longLabel Loop B names loop A as parent
type bed 3

track loopChild
parent loopA on
shortLabel child
longLabel A subtrack of loop A
type bed 3
